      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُدْنٌ</span></b>  [properly an inf. n.; see 1:] <i>Fatness and
compactness; </i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُدُنٌ</span></b> . (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <i>Fat;</i>
i. e. the <i>substance termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَحْمٌ</span>. (M, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
It is also a pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدَنَةٌ</span>: (T, S, &amp;c.:) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  and of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَادِنٌ</span>. (M, TA.)

